<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #111;">
  <h2 style="color: #1d4ed8;">Confirm your new email</h2>
  <p>Hi <%= firstName %>,</p>
  <p>You asked to change your Endurance Analytics Hub email address to <strong><%= newEmail %></strong>. Click the button below to confirm — your old address will keep working until you do.</p>
  <p style="margin: 32px 0;">
    <a href="<%= link %>"
       style="background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
      Confirm new email
    </a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
    Or paste this link into your browser:<br />
    <a href="<%= link %>" style="color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all;"><%= link %></a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 32px;">
    This link expires in 24 hours. If you didn't request this change, you can ignore this email — your account is safe.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
